            "Your licence has expired or was cancelled, so nothing new can be saved. Your saved designs are still here; renew to save again.": [
                "Lisans\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n s\u00fcresi doldu veya iptal edildi, bu nedenle yeni bir \u015fey kaydedilemez. Kaydetti\u011finiz tasar\u0131mlar h\u00e2l\u00e2 burada; yeniden kaydetmek i\u00e7in yenileyin."
