            ],
            "Your library is kept in your own storage bucket, so no Zinn Digital\u00ae quota applies.": [
                "Kitapl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z kendi depolama alan\u0131n\u0131zda tutulur, bu nedenle hi\u00e7bir Zinn Digital\u00ae kotas\u0131 uygulanmaz."
