            "%1$d of %2$d designs \u00b7 up to %3$s per design \u00b7 images are resized to 2560 px and stored once": [
                "%1$d \/ %2$d tasar\u0131m \u00b7 tasar\u0131m ba\u015f\u0131na en fazla %3$s \u00b7 g\u00f6rseller 2560 px boyutuna getirilir ve bir kez depolan\u0131r"
